    <h2>About the Work</h2>

    <p>
      This online artwork invites people to add words to a sentence that
      continues to grow. Instead of being written by one person, the
      sentence develops through contributions from visitors, making
      participation central to the work.
    </p>

    <h2>Connection to the Exhibition</h2>

    <p>
      Davis’s project challenges the idea that an artwork needs one author.
      The audience helps create the piece, turning the internet into a
      shared space. This connects to early net art’s interest in
      interaction and in changing the relationship between artist,
      artwork, and viewer.
    </p>

